\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Takeaway: the reference helps at $k{=}1$, inverts as $k$ grows, and the any-correct-answer instruction rescues the strongest judge tested (phi-4, right) while leaving the mid-size judge (Qwen-7B, left) inflated.} Excess hack gap versus number of valid answers $k$ on the synthetic Qwen-generator pool, under four context conditions; whiskers are 95\% bootstrap CIs from \texttt  {synthk\_results.json}. Marker shapes and line styles distinguish conditions in addition to color.}}{11}{figure.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
